k.","id":"3457ea5d33aa","source":"BTS 16 · #16","image":"/img/scene-clips/5016.webp","imageBytes":16084,"video":"/videos/scene-clips/5016.mp4","videoBytes":154984,"duration":5.875},"c94053c6a126":{"text":"Would you forgive them?","id":"c94053c6a126","source":"BTS 16 · #81","image":"/img/scene-clips/7202.webp","imageBytes":26936,"video":"/videos/scene-clips/7202.mp4","videoBytes":164601,"duration":4.041667},"294571c0a60c":{"text":"I would invent a time machine.","id":"294571c0a60c","source":"BTS 16 · #36","image":"/img/scene-clips/7372.webp","imageBytes":29008,"video":"/videos/scene-clips/7372.mp4","videoBytes":237375,"duration":4.041667},"9bbdfe1ed882":{"text":"We need a cure for all diseases.","id":"9bbdfe1ed882","source":"BTS 16 · #52","image":"/img/scene-clips/7404.webp","imageBytes":25060,"video":"/videos/scene-clips/7404.mp4","videoBytes":150525,"duration":4.041667},"10c47089947b":{"text":"What qualities do inventors need?","id":"10c47089947b","source":"BTS 16 · #55","image":"/img/scene-clips/7421.webp","imageBytes":23754,"video":"/videos/scene-clips/7421.mp4","videoBytes":110346,"duration":4.041667},"f53f38e6ad6a":{"text":"Do you ever flip a coin to decide?","id":"f53f38e6ad6a","source":"BTS 16 · #91","image":"/img/scene-clips/7441.webp","imageBytes":11696,"video":"/videos/scene-clips/7441.mp4","videoBytes":77060,"duration":4.041667},"e2cfafe984b0":{"text":"Yes, and I felt terrible about it.","id":"e2cfafe984b0","source":"BTS 16 · #64","image":"/img/scene-clips/7450.webp","imageBytes":20146,"video":"/videos/scene-clips/7450.mp4","videoBytes":103216,"duration":4.041667},"c111e67d60ec":{"text":"Yes, my parents are very reliable.","id":"c111e67d60ec","source":"BTS 16 · #74","image":"/img/scene-clips/7451.webp","imageBytes":19306,"video":"/videos/scene-clips/7451.mp4","videoBytes":215740,"duration":4.041667},"1a5bd2585e9c":{"text":"They will not talk to the stranger.","id":"1a5bd2585e9c","source":"BTS 16 · #4","image":"/img/scene-clips/7468.webp","imageBytes":21242,"video":"/videos/scene-clips/7468.mp4","videoBytes":202461,"duration":4.041667}},"examples":["Oh no! There's a monster! What will he do?","He will fight it, and he will go to his palace.","They will not talk to the stranger.","Would you choose pizza or hamburgers for dinner?","I would choose the blue one.","If you could have any superpower, what would it be?","I would choose to fly.","Creativity, patience, and persistence are important.","What is the most important invention?","I think about the pros and cons carefully.","I think the telephone is very important.","Who invented the light bulb?","Thomas Edison invented the light bulb.","Is it always wrong to break a promise?","I promise I will do my best.","Can you keep a promise?","Yes, I always keep my promises.","She promised to help me with my homework.","He made a promise to be on time.","I would invent a time machine.","I promise to study harder this year.","What do you promise to do better?","I promise to be kind to everyone.","Why did you make that choice?","Because pizza is my favorite food.","Do you like making choices?","Yes, but sometimes it is difficult.","Choosing between two colleges was very difficult.","What was the hardest choice you ever made?","Do you ever flip a coin to decide?","Did you regret your choice?","No, I am happy with my decision.","How do you make important decisions?","Do you ask other people for advice?","Several people contributed to inventing the computer.","Yes, I sometimes talk to my family.","What would you use it for?","I would go back and visit my younger self.","How has technology changed our lives?","Technology has made everything faster and easier.","I think the internet is the best invention.","What would happen without the internet?","We would have to go back to using libraries and phones.","Do you use the internet every day?","Yes, I use it for school and entertainment.","What inventions do you think we still need?","We need a cure for all diseases.","Would you like to be an inventor?","Yes, I think inventing things would be fun.","What qualities do inventors need?","Can anyone become an inventor?","Yes, if they work hard and believe in themselves.","Do you promise to be honest?","Yes, honesty is very important to me.","Why is keeping promises important?","Because it shows respect and builds trust.","Have you ever broken a promise?","Yes, and I felt terrible about it.","What did you do to make it right?","I apologized and made a new promise.","I try my best, but it can be difficult.","I promise to be more patient with others.","I will practice being calm and understanding.","Yes, my parents are very reliable.","They promised to support my dreams.","Do you trust your friends?","What would you do if a friend broke a promise?","Would you forgive them?","Yes, as long as they apologize sincerely.","Not always, but you should have a good reason.","A white lie is a small untruth told to avoid hurting someone.","Is it okay to tell a white lie?","I think it is usually better to be honest.","How do you choose between two options?","I list the advantages and disadvantages of each.","What would you choose if you could have anything?","I would choose happiness and good health.","Is money the most important thing?","What choice would change your life?","Choosing the right career would be life-changing.","Have you made any important life choices yet?","Not yet, but I know I will have to soon."]}
